음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-5189500","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:10:13Z","value":39,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5247530","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5189500-1846018067942953","game_id":"steam-5189500","kind":"announcement","title":"We're removing generative AI from the game","summary":"Hey everyone, When we made A Place for Every Potion, we used generative AI for some of the textures and for the music. Many of you asked us to change that, so now we're replacing it. MusicThis part is done. All the music in the full game has been replaced with human-made music. We're also updating the AI disclosure on the store page, so music will no longer be listed there. TexturesA freelance artist kindly offered to help, and now we're replacing the textures together! We can't promise it will ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T05:38:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942953","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:15:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5189500-1846018067940311","game_id":"steam-5189500","kind":"announcement","title":"New level: One Giant Heap","summary":"Hey friends, We've added a second level to the game. Where to find itOnce you've put all 4,160 potions on their shelves, the New Game button in the main menu turns into New Game II. Press it and you're back in the same lab, but this time every bottle is waiting in one huge pile in the middle of the room. What's differentIt's harder than the first run. More bottles have four different colours in them, and more of the liquid starts out in beakers. There's no tutorial this time, you go straight to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T08:24:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940311","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:15:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5189500-1846018067940241","game_id":"steam-5189500","kind":"announcement","title":"New skill added: Pour Where It Stands","summary":"Hi everyone!Until now, if the bottle you wanted to pour into was already standing on a shelf, you had to take it down first.Not anymore. Meet the new skill: Pour Where It Stands. What it doesPour the bottle in your hand straight into a bottle standing in a slot: on a cabinet shelf, on a table, even into a beaker. The bottle stays where it is. Its cork pops out, the potion pours in, and the cork flies back home.Why you'll want itShelve a bottle before it's full and finish it right on the shelf la","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T07:48:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940241","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:15:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5189500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:05Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5189500":"2026-10-26T09:28:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5189500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:05Z"},"5247530":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:06Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5189500","app_id":5189500,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:40Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country"